---
import logo from "../assets/logo-full-transparent.svg";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<Layout
	description="临界有光，边界可通。做极简、可靠的产品，持续探索技术前沿。"
>
	<div class="page">
		<header class="site-header">
			<a class="brand" href="/">
				<img src={logo.src} width="32" height="28" alt="" />
				<span>临界微光</span>
			</a>
			<a class="header-link" href="https://github.com/glimverge">GitHub</a>
		</header>

		<main>
			<section class="hero">
				<h1><span>临界有光，</span><span>边界可通</span></h1>
				<p class="en">Where edges meet, glimmers emerge.</p>
				<p class="lead">做极简、可靠的产品，持续探索技术前沿。</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>关于</h2>
				<p class="about">
					名字由 Glimmer 与 Verge 拼合而来。Verge
					指临界，站在突破的边缘；Glimmer
					是微光，寻求突破的那一缕契机。工作站在突破的边缘上，以探索未知、寻求契机为主。AI
					与全栈是手段。
				</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>方向</h2>
				<ul class="directions">
					<li>
						<h3>AI 与工作流</h3>
						<p>
							<span>将新能力纳入真实工作流，</span><span>试出可促成突破的路径。</span>
						</p>
					</li>
					<li>
						<h3>全栈工程</h3>
						<p>从前端到后端贯通实现，让试探能够持续落地。</p>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>项目</h2>
				<article class="project">
					<h3 class="project-name">moomem</h3>
					<p class="project-kicker">
						<span>MoonBit 嵌入式 Agent 记忆层。</span>
						<span>零部署、崩溃可恢复、按用户隔离。</span>
					</p>
					<p>
						Agent 进程一结束就失忆。moomem
						嵌在宿主进程里，不用单独起服务。native
						上把记忆写进本地目录，关掉再打开还能召回。
					</p>
					<ul class="traits">
						<li>open、add、recall、forget</li>
						<li>导入、导出与统计</li>
						<li>向量与 BM25 混合检索，索引按用户分开</li>
						<li>双槽快照，写入中途崩溃仍可恢复</li>
						<li>缺省离线，不需要 API Key</li>
					</ul>
					<p class="project-links">
						<a href="https://github.com/glimverge/moomem">源码</a>
						<a href="https://glimverge.github.io/moomem/">文档</a>
					</p>
				</article>
			</section>
		</main>

		<footer class="site-footer">
			<a href="mailto:hello@glimverge.com">hello@glimverge.com</a>
			<nav aria-label="社交">
				<a href="https://github.com/glimverge">GitHub</a>
				<a href="https://juejin.cn/user/4404007135100058">掘金</a>
				<a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/68fdd72c0000000037005231"
					>小红书</a
				>
			</nav>
			<p class="colophon">于细微处，见临界通</p>
		</footer>
	</div>
</Layout>
